KAPERKUNDE FORK AND CONTAINER IMAGE
================================================================================

This copy is Kaperkunde's fork (https://github.com/kaperkunde/pdf-mcp-server)
of upstream v2.0.0 (commit f5f3cee3b17f24ea8221058702c4163370ce2c90), with
